======================================================================================================================
k_unexplained-regularities_closure -- is 'it is a restatement of the RAR' a coincidence or a theorem?
======================================================================================================================

  131 SPARC discs with >= 8 radii, an outer point and an inner point, positive gas and stars.

  shuffle: a seeded derangement of the extras Z across galaxies (seed 20260903); 131/131 galaxies get someone else's Z.

----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
THE CLOSURE TEST.  max |residual - residual with the extras shuffled|, per candidate, per footing.
  ~0  => the extras CANCEL => the candidate is the RAR reparametrised => RESTATEMENT.
  >0  => the candidate carries information beyond the RAR => LIVE.
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  candidate                                                 canonical            alt   verdict
