  B  mass discrepancy  (g_obs/g_bar)                        0.000e+00      0.000e+00   RESTATEMENT
  C  dark matter fraction  (1 - g_bar/g_obs)                0.000e+00      0.000e+00   RESTATEMENT
  D  dark-to-luminous speed ratio                           0.000e+00      0.000e+00   RESTATEMENT
  E  phantom surface density  ((g_o-g_b)/2piG)              0.000e+00      0.000e+00   RESTATEMENT
  F  Bosma factor on the STARS instead of the HI            1.249e-16      1.388e-16   RESTATEMENT
  G  phantom enclosed mass  ((g_o-g_b) r^2/G)               1.943e-16      1.527e-16   RESTATEMENT
